Z||000000||chris6878||05-11-2000||05:13 PM||||<BR>I am getting a code 44....<P>When i start the car up in the morning, it starts very easily at the fist bump of the starter. When it gets warmed up u have to press the gas a little to start it.. and when it gets so warm.. forget it until it cools, cause she wont start....          but other than this she runs fine...   ????<P>||||reg||5
Z||000001||chris6878||05-11-2000||06:38 PM||||also add code 42...   just checked ecm again after a 25 minute drive...    two codes this time  42, and the 44 from yesterday...     my car also takes a while for the rpm's to drop when ya rev it now, you can rev it up to 2000 rpms and it will take about 5-6 second before it drops back to 1000 rpms...  like you havent let off the gas yet...  <P>what could be the prob.. ?  egr? tube?||||reg||3
